    "basis": "Two-step cycle, right leg leading at t=0. lockie2003 and martinezserrano2021 show more trunk lean and joint flexion with heavier sleds and keogh2010sled a more horizontal trunk than sprinting; sanjaya2014 found 30° best for static pushing. The 45° lean and leg angles are estimates. MET: the 2024 Compendium has no sled entry; 02050 (vigorous resistance training, 6.0) is a stand-in."
